# --- Store policy: data in git, binaries and derived renders on disk only ---
# Archived policy weights: 244MB+ of TorchScript binaries and growing. The
# AUDITABLE record (index.jsonl, events.jsonl) IS committed, so every
# promotion, epitaph, and eval score stays in history. The weights themselves
# are local artifacts. Nothing is deleted (core.md principle 4) — they are
# simply not version-controlled. If off-machine durability is wanted, that is
# a separate decision (git-lfs or object storage).
store/archive/*.pt

# Derived renders. Learning rule: store the DATA (json), regenerate the
# picture with a versioned renderer on demand. Never commit a chart.
store/cards/**/*.png
store/cards/**/*.html
store/cards/*.png
